Quezon City 1100</div><div class="pp-contact-bits">+63 2 8123 4567 · billing@example.com · https://example.com</div></div><div class="pp-title-block"><h1>Supplier Statement of Account</h1><table class="pp-meta"><tbody><tr><th>No.</th><td>UNO Computer Supply (Sample)</td></tr><tr><th>Date</th><td>Oct 30, 2026</td></tr><tr><th>Status</th><td>OPEN</td></tr></tbody></table></div></header><section class="pp-party" aria-label="Supplier"><div class="pp-label">Supplier</div><div class="pp-strong">UNO Computer Supply (Sample)</div><div>TIN 000-333-444-000</div><div><span class="pp-label-inline">Billing: </span><span class="pp-pre">Makati City</span></div><div><span class="pp-label-inline">Delivery: </span><span class="pp-pre">HACIEN warehouse</span></div><div class="pp-party-contact"><div class="pp-strong">Ben Santos</div>+63 917 000 0002 · ben@example.com</div></section><table class="pp-items pp-ledger"><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Description</th><th class="num">Charges</th><th class="num">Credits</th><th class="num">Balance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colSpan="4">Opening balance</td><td class="num">₱0.00</td></tr><tr><td>Oct 5, 2026</td><td class="pp-pre">Bill INV-SAMPLE-1</td><td class="num">₱5,000.00</td><td class="num">—</td><td class="num">₱5,000.00</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr><th colSpan="4">Closing balance</th><th class="num">₱5,000.00</th></tr></tfoot></table><p class="pp-words"><span class="pp-label-inline">Amount in words: </span>Five thousand pesos only</p><footer class="pp-foot"><div class="pp-foot-main"><div class="pp-tax-line">Statement of account — not an official invoice/receipt</div><div class="pp-contact-line">+63 2 8123 4567 · billing@example.com</div></div><div class="pp-page-num" aria-hidden="true"></div></footer></article>"
`;
